OL,3,ATwo unvaccinated people die of measles
OL,4,Ain Pennsylvania
OL,5,
OL,6,FEighty-five percent of kindergarten-age
OL,7,Fstudents in Lancaster County, where the
OL,8,Frecent deaths occurred, are vaccinated
OL,9,Fagainst measles - well below the 95%
OL,10,Frate needed for herd immunity to limit
OL,11,Fthe spread and protect
OL,12,Fimmunocompromised people.
